     6140       bfs_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-base-doc    =  - bf_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-base-doc
     6141       bfs_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-rubl-doc    =  - bf_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-rubl-doc
